      "writtenOn": "2023-02-20T20:20:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, after this cl apis that move from system to public will work properly. Because the api will still be in the system api-versions.xml file, but with an earlier `since` value. In the public api-versions.xml file, they\u0027ll have a later `since` value, but that will only apply for apps compiling against purely the public api. So this cl should solve nykkumar@\u0027s issue.\n\nThe lint warning would come up in ayeaye when someone touches a line with the issue. If you don\u0027t change that line ayeaye wouldn\u0027t complain.\n\nI\u0027m not to familiar about the details of the lint update, you\u0027d have to ask Matt.",
